div.p:
Present at the 139th meeting of the Council were the President of the United
                    States, presiding; the Vice President of the United States; the Secretary of
                    State; the Secretary of Defense; and the Director for Mutual Security. Also
                    present were the Secretary of the Treasury; the Attorney General (for Item 1);
                    the Secretary of the Interior (for Item 1); the Director, Bureau of the Budget;
                    the Acting Director of Defense Mobilization; the Chairman, Joint Chiefs of
                    Staff; the Director of Central Intelligence; the Special Assistant to the
                    President for National Security Affairs; the Special Assistant to the President
                    for Cold War Planning; the Military Liaison Officer; the Executive Secretary,
                    NSC; and the Deputy Executive Secretary, NSC.
